        "source_sentence": "Powdered polymer samples of 200–300 mg, previously dried at 120 °C over phosphorus pentoxide for 24 h in a vacuum oven, were placed in a box containing a supersaturated solution of sodium nitrite at 25 °C, which provided a relative humidity of 65%. The samples were periodically weighed through 48 h, at which time they had equilibrated with their surrounding, as indicated by no weight change."
